  "liner": {
   "body_md": "Mountain Goats performed a full-length concert at The Fillmore in San Francisco, California, on September 12, 2019 [1][3]. The show featured twenty-four songs, including tracks from albums such as In League with Dragons, The Sunset Tree, and Heretic Pride [1]. Rare archival performances of songs like “An Antidote for Strychnine,” “No More Tears,” and “The Only Thing I Know” were part of the set [1]. The band shared spoken stories between songs, touching on topics like “Wizard King,” “In League with Dragons,” and “Possum by Night” [1]. This recording, captured by Anonymous and LMGBTapes, is the only available audio for this date [1]. A concert poster for the event, designed by Aaron Akbari-Mort, is credited to Visible Vibrations [3]. The performance is the 292nd in the archive’s collection for the band [2].",
   "citations": [
